\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4caea3ec elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"4caea3ec\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-64afc7d5\" data-id=\"64afc7d5\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53cad95 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"53cad95\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-family: 'Segoe UI Historic', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505; font-size: 15px;\"><div class=\"m8h3af8h l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Professor Alamgir Hossain, Vice President &amp; Professor of Artificial Intelligence, contributed the following points to the Seminar on \u201cDiplomacy in Cyberspace: Thriving through geopolitical storms,\u201d organized by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, held on 24th August 2022:<\/div><\/div><div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">-He indicated that everything connected to the Internet is hackable. Almost 90% of problems are due to human errors\/behaviors.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&#8211; When we buy equipment from many countries to develop infrastructure (for example, energy), there are different IoT security issues. Therefore, the selection of country and security issues of IoTs should be part of the policy.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&#8211; The AI-powered attack is dangerous, so we must develop an AI-powered protection scheme. It requires collaborative multi-disciplinary teamwork.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">&#8211; The DDoS attack is serious for e-commerce companies, particularly small companies in developing countries. Policy and practices to handle these are essential.<\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-71b833ce elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"71b833ce\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-f3e5d49\" data-id=\"f3e5d49\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elemento